<h3>2026-09-25 — Admin dashboard link for AI Agent Management</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> The Admin dashboard AI card only linked to model configuration (<code>/admin/ai/configure</code> → <code>/ai/admin/models</code>). Added <code>AI Agent Management</code> pointing at the existing <code>/ai/admin/agents</code> route (also in the Admin top menu).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Agent registry/admin is the other half of AI system administration and was unreachable from the dashboard.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Comserv/root/admin/index.tt</code> <code>Comserv/root/Navigation/admintopmenu.tt</code></p>
</div>
